{
  "id": "Lyo.Barcode.Web.Components",
  "name": "Lyo.Barcode.Web.Components",
  "area": "Data",
  "tagline": "Reusable **Blazor / MudBlazor** components for exercising the **`IBarcodeService`** surface from `Lyo.Barcode`.",
  "description": "Reusable **Blazor / MudBlazor** components for exercising the **`IBarcodeService`** surface from [`Lyo.Barcode`](../Lyo.Barcode/README.md).",
  "features": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "DI / required services",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "using Lyo.Barcode.Native;\n\nservices.AddNativeBarcodeService(o => o.DefaultFormat = BarcodeFormat.Svg);\n// + the Lyo.Web.Components / MudBlazor wiring used elsewhere in the host"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Components",
      "headers": [
        "Component",
        "Purpose"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "**`<BarcodeWorkbench />`**",
          "Generate **Code 128** barcodes in BMP or SVG, with controls for module width, bar height, quiet zone, bar/background/border colors, optional human-readable caption (font, gap, padding, color override), and live preview/download via `IBarcodeService.GenerateAsync`."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "DI / required services",
      "text": "The workbench resolves **`IBarcodeService`** plus `IJsInterop` and `ISnackbar` from the host. Register a barcode implementation (e.g. `Lyo.Barcode.Native`) and the standard `Lyo.Web.Components` services:"
    }
  ],
